@* Меню как в шаблоне Blazor: на широком экране — колонка слева, на телефоне — полоса сверху с кнопкой, раскрывающей список. *@

<div class="top-row">
    <a class="navbar-brand" href="">PaperKey</a>
    <input type="checkbox" title="Меню" class="navbar-toggler" @bind="_open" />
</div>

<div class="nav-scrollable @(_open ? "open" : "")" @onclick="Close">
    <nav class="nav">
        <NavLink class="nav-link" href="" Match="NavLinkMatch.All">
            <svg class="nav-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 3h9l5 5v13H6z M14 3v6h6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M9 13h8M9 17h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg>
            Генератор
        </NavLink>
        <NavLink class="nav-link" href="check">
            <svg class="nav-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M8 12.5l3 3 5-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            Проверка
        </NavLink>
        <NavLink class="nav-link" href="scan">
            <svg class="nav-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 8V5h3M17 5h3v3M20 16v3h-3M7 19H4v-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            Сканер
        </NavLink>
        <NavLink class="nav-link" href="help">
            <svg class="nav-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M9.5 9.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 3.5 2.3c-.7.4-1 .9-1 1.7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="12" cy="17" r="1" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
            Справка
        </NavLink>
    </nav>
</div>

@code {
    private bool _open;

    private void Close() => _open = false;
}
